- | `pattern` | docs/patterns/ → eventually chunks/ | Needs maturation before knowledge base |
- | `knowledge` | chunks/ or SQLite | Searchable, scored |
- | `log` | topic files | Append-only, reference |
- | `event` | JSON state | Timestamped, queryable |
